  (1517, 'disappear', 'verb', 'a2', '4.0 - 4.5', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɪə(r)/', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɪr/', 'biến mất, biến đi', 'to become impossible to see', 'With that, Matt promptly disappeared.', 'Nói xong Matt nhanh chóng biến mất.', '{}'::text[], ARRAY['vanish', 'end', 'stop', 'finish']::text[], ARRAY['appear']::text[], '{"noun": "disability", "adjective": "disabled"}'::jsonb, 'disappear_uk.mp3', 'disappear_us.mp3', 'Academic, Research & Abstract Concepts', 'Abstract Ideas & Theories'),
  (1518, 'disappoint', 'verb', 'b2', '6.0 - 6.5', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪnt/', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪnt/', 'không làm thoả ước vọng, không làm thoả ý mong đợi (của ai), làm chán ngán, làm thất vọ ...', 'to make somebody feel sad because something that they hope for or expect to happen does not happen or is not as good as they hoped', 'disappoint (somebody), Her decision to cancel the concert is bound to disappoint her fans.', 'làm thất vọng (ai đó), quyết định hủy buổi hòa nhạc của cô ấy chắc chắn sẽ làm người hâm mộ thất vọng.', ARRAY['disappoint (somebody', 'disappoint fans']::text[], ARRAY['let down', 'disillusion', 'dishearten']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"noun": "disability", "adjective": "disabled"}'::jsonb, 'disappoint_uk.mp3', 'disappoint_us.mp3', 'Emotions, Personality & Behavior', 'Positive Emotions & Traits'),
  (1519, 'disappointed', 'adjective', 'b1', '5.0 - 5.5', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntɪd/', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntɪd/', '@disappoint', 'upset because something you hoped for has not happened or been as good, successful, etc. as you expected', 'The singer has promised to refund any disappointed fans.', 'Nam ca sĩ hứa sẽ hoàn lại tiền cho bất kỳ người hâm mộ thất vọng nào.', ARRAY['disappointed fans']::text[], ARRAY['defeated', 'discomfited', 'foiled', 'frustrated']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"noun": "disability", "verb": "disagree"}'::jsonb, 'disappointed_uk.mp3', 'disappointed_us.mp3', 'Arts, Media & Entertainment', 'Music & Performance'),
  (1520, 'disappointing', 'adjective', 'b1', '5.0 - 5.5', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntɪŋ/', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntɪŋ/', 'làm chán ngán, làm thất vọng', 'not as good, successful, etc. as you had hoped; making you feel disappointed', 'a disappointing result/performance/defeat', 'một kết quả/sự thể hiện/thất bại đáng thất vọng', ARRAY['disappointing result/performance', 'disappointing result']::text[], ARRAY['dissatisfactory', 'unsatisfying', 'unsatisfactory']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"noun": "disability", "verb": "disagree"}'::jsonb, 'disappointing_uk.mp3', 'disappointing_us.mp3', 'Sports, Fitness & Leisure', 'Matches & Competitions'),
  (1521, 'disappointment', 'noun', 'b2', '6.0 - 6.5', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntmənt/', '/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪntmənt/', 'sự chán ngán, sự thất vọng', 'the feeling of being sad because something has not happened or been as good, successful, etc. as you expected or hoped', 'Book early for the show to avoid disappointment.', 'Đặt sớm cho chương trình để tránh thất vọng.', '{}'::text[], ARRAY['letdown', 'dissatisfaction', 'failure']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"adjective": "disabled", "verb": "disagree"}'::jsonb, 'disappointment_uk.mp3', 'disappointment_us.mp3', 'Emotions, Personality & Behavior', 'Negative Emotions & Traits'),
  (1522, 'disaster', 'noun', 'a2', '4.0 - 4.5', '/dɪˈzɑːstə(r)/', '/dɪˈzæstər/', 'tai hoạ, thảm hoạ, tai ách', 'an unexpected event, such as a very bad accident, a flood or a fire, that kills a lot of people or causes a lot of damage', 'the world''s worst humanitarian disaster', 'thảm họa nhân đạo tồi tệ nhất thế giới', '{}'::text[], ARRAY['catastrophe', 'calamity', 'tragedy']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"adjective": "disabled", "verb": "disagree"}'::jsonb, 'disaster_uk.mp3', 'disaster_us.mp3', 'Global Issues & International Conflicts', 'Disasters & Crises'),
  (1523, 'disastrous', 'adjective', 'c1', '7.0 - 8.0+', '/dɪˈzɑːstrəs/', '/dɪˈzæstrəs/', 'tai hại, thảm khốc', 'very bad, harmful or unsuccessful', 'a disastrous harvest/fire/result', 'một vụ thu hoạch/cháy/kết quả thảm khốc', ARRAY['disastrous harvest/fire', 'disastrous harvest']::text[], ARRAY['black', 'calamitous', 'fatal', 'fateful']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"noun": "disability", "verb": "disagree"}'::jsonb, 'disastrous_uk.mp3', 'disastrous_us.mp3', 'Work, Employment & Career', 'Career Progression'),
  (1524, 'disc', 'noun', 'b2', '6.0 - 6.5', '/dɪsk/', '/dɪsk/', 'vật dẹt, tròn hình đĩa', 'a thin flat round object', 'He wears an identity disc around his neck.', 'Anh ta đeo một chiếc đĩa nhận dạng quanh cổ.', '{}'::text[], ARRAY['record', 'disk', 'platter', 'saucer']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"verb": "discard"}'::jsonb, 'disc_uk.mp3', 'disc_us.mp3', 'Housing, Architecture & Daily Life', 'Buildings & Structures'),
