  (1527, 'discipline', 'noun', 'b2', '6.0 - 6.5', '/ˈdɪsəplɪn/', '/ˈdɪsəplɪn/', 'môn học, ngành kiến thức', 'the practice of training people to obey rules and orders and punishing them if they do not; the controlled behaviour or situation that is the result of this training', 'The school has a reputation for high standards of discipline.', 'Trường nổi tiếng về tiêu chuẩn kỷ luật cao.', '{}'::text[], ARRAY['self-control', 'order', 'restraint']::text[], ARRAY['indiscipline']::text[], '{"verb": "discard"}'::jsonb, 'discipline_uk.mp3', 'discipline_us.mp3', 'Education & Academic Life', 'Schools & Universities'),
  (1528, 'disclose', 'verb', 'c1', '7.0 - 8.0+', '/dɪsˈkləʊz/', '/dɪsˈkləʊz/', 'vạch trần, phơi bày', 'to give somebody information about something, especially something that was previously secret', 'disclose something (to somebody), The spokesman refused to disclose details of the takeover to the press.', 'tiết lộ điều gì đó (cho ai đó), Người phát ngôn từ chối tiết lộ chi tiết về việc tiếp quản với báo chí.', ARRAY['disclose something (to somebody', 'disclose something', 'disclose details']::text[], ARRAY['reveal', 'expose', 'divulge']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"noun": "disc"}'::jsonb, 'disclose_uk.mp3', 'disclose_us.mp3', 'Arts, Media & Entertainment', 'News, Media & Broadcasting'),
  (1529, 'disclosure', 'noun', 'c1', '7.0 - 8.0+', '/dɪsˈkləʊʒə(r)/', '/dɪsˈkləʊʒər/', 'sự vạch trần, sự phơi bày', 'the act of making something known or public that was previously secret or private', 'the newspaper’s disclosure of defence secrets', 'báo chí làm lộ bí mật quốc phòng', ARRAY['disclosure of defence secrets']::text[], ARRAY['revelation', 'revealing']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"verb": "discard"}'::jsonb, 'disclosure_uk.mp3', 'disclosure_us.mp3', 'Society, Politics & Government', 'Government Policy & Welfare'),
  (1530, 'discount', 'noun', 'b1', '5.0 - 5.5', '/ˈdɪskaʊnt/', '/ˈdɪskaʊnt/', 'bán hạ giá, bán giảm giá', 'an amount of money that is taken off the usual cost of something', 'to get/offer a discount', 'để có được/đề nghị giảm giá', ARRAY['to get/offer']::text[], ARRAY['deduction', 'decrease', 'diminution', 'reduction']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"verb": "discard"}'::jsonb, 'discount_uk.mp3', 'discount_us.mp3', 'Business, Trade & Finance', 'Banking & Money'),
  (1531, 'discount', 'verb', 'b2', '6.0 - 6.5', '/ˈdɪskaʊnt/', '/ˈdɪskaʊnt/', 'bán hạ giá, bán giảm giá', 'to take an amount of money off the usual cost of something; to sell something at a discount', 'be discounted by something, Most of our stock has been discounted by up to 40 per cent.', 'được giảm giá bởi thứ gì đó, Hầu hết hàng tồn kho của chúng tôi đã được giảm giá tới 40%.', ARRAY['be discounted by something']::text[], ARRAY['deduction', 'decrease', 'diminution', 'reduction']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"noun": "disc"}'::jsonb, 'discount_uk.mp3', 'discount_us.mp3', 'Business, Trade & Finance', 'Banking & Money'),
