  (1749, 'embarrassed', 'adjective', 'b1', '5.0 - 5.5', '/ɪmˈbærəst/', '/ɪmˈbærəst/', 'lúng túng, bối rối, ngượng', 'shy, uncomfortable or ashamed, especially in a social situation', 'I''ve never felt so embarrassed in my life!', 'Tôi chưa bao giờ cảm thấy xấu hổ như vậy trong đời!', ARRAY['embarrassed in my life', 'embarrassed in']::text[], ARRAY['abashed', 'chagrined', 'discomposed', 'discomfited']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"verb": "embark", "noun": "embarrassment"}'::jsonb, 'embarrassed_uk.mp3', 'embarrassed_us.mp3', 'Society, Politics & Government', 'Civil Society & Human Rights'),
